<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
    <dict>
        <key>Description</key>
        <string>Hands the downloaded HandBrake installer to CimianImporter, which publishes it as a new version of the item into a Cimian repository (as a copy of the item's newest pkginfo, with what belongs to the installer file replaced), or says that nothing is new. The version label is the one that the download recipe took from the installer's file name, not the release tag; CimianImporter's answer to that label has NOT been seen yet, and the first dry run shows it. This is a dry run, which writes nothing, until the recipe's override sets cimian_dry_run to false. The repository is the input cimian_repo or the AutoPkg preference CIMIAN_REPO. The program needs Microsoft's .NET Desktop Runtime on the PC, and the installer is not known to bring it: the item needs a requires on a runtime item that this repository does not have yet (see the README).</string>
        <key>Identifier</key>
        <string>com.github.serrc-techops.cimian.HandBrake</string>
        <key>Input</key>
        <dict>
            <key>CIMIAN_NAME</key>
            <string>handbrake</string>
            <key>CIMIAN_SUBDIRECTORY</key>
            <string></string>
            <key>NAME</key>
            <string>HandBrake</string>
            <key>pkginfo</key>
            <dict>
                <key>developer</key>
                <string>The HandBrake Team</string>
                <key>display_name</key>
                <string>HandBrake</string>
            </dict>
        </dict>
        <key>MinimumVersion</key>
        <string>1.0.0</string>
        <key>ParentRecipe</key>
        <string>com.github.serrc-techops.download.HandBrake-Win</string>
        <key>Process</key>
        <array>
            <dict>
                <key>Processor</key>
                <string>com.github.serrc-techops.SharedProcessors/CimianImporter</string>
                <key>Arguments</key>
                <dict>
                    <key>pathname</key>
                    <string>%pathname%</string>
                    <key>cimian_name</key>
                    <string>%CIMIAN_NAME%</string>
                    <key>cimian_subdirectory</key>
                    <string>%CIMIAN_SUBDIRECTORY%</string>
                    <key>version</key>
                    <string>%version%</string>
                </dict>
            </dict>
        </array>
    </dict>
</plist>
